
    config KERN_STATELESS
        bool "Stateless SD-bundle payload"
        default n
        help
            Build the application for the Phase 22 stateless loader. The app
            runs from PSRAM with no flash-resident app partition of its own;
            IDF's esp_ota_get_running_partition() cannot resolve a partition
            from a PSRAM XIP address, so a small stateless wrapper returns the
            payload's metadata factory partition instead.
